# SEO record

Before adding a site folder, a public route, AdSense/ads.txt, robots, sitemap, or schema, read `/SEO_RECORD.md` and follow its blueprint.

After the change ships, tick or add the matching site section in that file. Do not invent a parallel SEO setup.

Hard rules from the record:

- One AdSense site: `toolfolio.page`. Same `ca-pub-5974580626732926` snippet on subdomains.
- `ads.txt` only at `https://toolfolio.page/ads.txt`.
- Never set `alternates.canonical: "/"` on a root layout.
- Footer Privacy + Ads disclosure must point at the hub URLs.
- Do not mix niches on one subdomain.
